  "label": "Tom Hardy is the authoritative figure dismissing 'snowflakes'",
  "description": "The visual of Tom Hardy with his stern, dismissive expression is mapped onto the textual concept of an authoritative figure who rejects those perceived as easily offended ('snowflakes'). The text 'move along snowflake if you're easily offended' is directly projected onto Tom Hardy's visual persona, using his image to embody the role of the dismissive authority figure. His expression and presence are used to analogically represent the textual message of exclusion and contempt.",
